	(text "PLANTO - Raspberry Pi 5 smart planter HAT\nI2C: GPIO2 SDA / GPIO3 SCL -> ADS1115 @ 0x48 (ADDR=GND), AIN0 = soil AO\nGPIO17 (pin 11) SENSOR_PWR_N  - LOW = sensor powered (P-FET Q1), pull-up keeps it off at boot\nGPIO27 (pin 13) SENSOR_DO     - LM393 wet/dry threshold output\nGPIO22 (pin 15) PUMP_EN       - HIGH = pump on (5V, N-FET Q2, D1 flyback)\nGPIO23 (pin 16) STATUS_LED    - HIGH = LED on\nGPIO24 (pin 18) ADC_ALERT     - ADS1115 ALERT/RDY (open-drain, R1 pull-up)\nSensor J2: 1 VCC  2 GND  3 DO  4 AO  (FC-28/YL-69 + LM393 module)\nCamera: Pi 5 CSI connector directly (not on this board)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
